# Story Specification: Kanban board with drag-and-drop using Next.js 16 Server Actions

**Project:** Work Management System
**Kind:** Story
**Priority:** High
**Dev estimate:** 32.0h
**QA estimate:** 12.0h

## Overview

Implement a drag-and-drop Kanban board for sprint tickets using @dnd-kit/core. Board columns: Backlog, In Progress, In Review, Done. Column transitions should call Next.js 16 Server Actions to persist status changes. Optimistic UI updates required.

